    "title": "Ribbon Cutting - 1-Tom-Plumber Gwinnett - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago We had a great time celebrating 1-Tom-Plumber Gwinnett at their ribbon cutting on February 5th. We love Atlanta, Buford, Lawrenceville, and neighboring communities in Gwinnett County, Georgia. As life-long residents and business owners, we wanted to bring a different kind of plumber experience to the area. Our purpose is to deliver true emergency plumbing using only the best plumbers who know how to provide the highest customer service. Whether it’s unclogging a kitchen drain, replacing a shower valve, or repairing a cracked sewer line, we won’t be satisfied until you’ve had an experience that you rave about to your family and friends. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
